                "additionalProperties": false,
                "description": "Every new analysis report MUST show both without_ai (AI 미사용) and with_ai (AI 사용) side by side, under identical requirements, Phase, quality and acceptance conditions. Compare role-based staffing/person-days, duration low/recommended/high, labor cost, tool/runtime costs, contingency, total budget low/recommended/high, and separate Confidence with evidence and unknowns. AI use is not assumed to be cheaper or faster. State source/data access permissions, permitted AI tools/models and execution environment, team AI proficiency, human review responsibilities and adoption/setup costs. Include AI subscriptions, API/token usage and runtime/environment costs with pricing assumptions and calculation basis; unknown costs remain unknown, not zero. Use available trial-implementation/build/critical-flow evidence; without it, use conservative assumptions and disclose the limitation in the AI scenario Confidence."
